Wed Oct 21 06:40:33 UTC 2026 - Paolo Stivanin <info@paolostivanin.com>

- Update to 0.10.0 (upstream tag v0.10.0, 2026-10-20):
  * New: Modify Group dialog, Track > Instrument menu, portable mode
    (portable.txt next to the executable), automation breakpoint
    dragging and Alt-click delete, editor AppStream screenshot.
  * Plugins: inserted plugins open automatically; VST3 shows
    identity-mapped parameter text; CLAP port layouts beyond host
    limits rejected.
  * Fixes: punch range before placing a take, step input over the
    next MIDI clip, Min:Secs rounding, Fedora font paths.
  * Hardening: oversized MCP batches rejected, size and range
    checks in WAV, base64 and MIDI writers.
  * Re-vendored; no new system deps.

