Sun Oct 18 17:32:34 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.8.0 (upstream tag v0.8.0, 2026-10-17):
  * Follow stored paths only on this computer or the session's
    share (hardening against session-file misdirection); engine
    tests compile on Windows again. ProRes frame-size guards
    before plane allocation;
  * Re-vendor with update=true: arboard 3.7.0, combine 4.6.9,
    font-types 0.12.7, libc 0.2.191, zip 9.0.5, zvariant 5.15.1,
    craft-docpath 0.1.0 (MIT OR Apache-2.0); windows-sys 0.60.2
    pruned; craft-ui git rev unchanged (5c874d5). License audit
    finds no new copyleft (MPL-2.0 symphonia and Apache-2.0-option
    self_cell as before), so the License tag is unchanged. No CVEs
    in the v0.7.0 to v0.8.0 range, and no ruzstd in the vendor set
    (not affected by RUSTSEC-2026-0344).

